  percentiles.tenant[tenant].push(latencyMs);
}

// Monitor GPU pressure
gpuMetrics.on('memoryPressure', (utilization) => {
  if (utilization > 0.9) triggerAlert();
});
```

## Why This Is Asked

Explores a fresh angle: how resource throttling, GC pauses, and network jitter interact under realistic quotas in a containerized environment. It tests awareness of end-to-end observability and practical steps to isolate root causes in a beginner-friendly setting.

## Key Concepts

- Performance testing in containerized/Kubernetes environments
- CPU/memory quotas and throttling signals
- Garbage collection pauses and impact on latency
- Network jitter and its effect on tail latency
- Instrumentation and baseline comparison

